{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, מְלַל","hw":"מְלַל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מְלַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Pa.</strong>  <strong> speak, say (</strong>so 𝔗 Syriac; cf. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, מְלַל\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_מְלַל\", dir=\"rtl\">מלל</a> <strong>Pi.</strong> (rare)<strong>)</strong>;—Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלִּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:22\" href=\"/Daniel.6.22\">Dn 6:22</a> <em>he spoke</em> with (<span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> pers.); acc. of words, Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְמַלִּ֔ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:25\" href=\"/Daniel.7.25\">7:25</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְצַד</span> of God); so Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְמַלִּל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">8</a> (van d. H. here <span dir=\"rtl\">מְמַלֵּל</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:20\" href=\"/Daniel.7.20\">20</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְמַלֱּלָא</span> (K<sup>§ 15 d)</sup>) v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:11\" href=\"/Daniel.7.11\">11</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מִלָּה²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, מְלֵךְ"}